      <data key="d2">对ICG荧光成像用于结直肠手术进行的系统评估报告，标题为《Indocyanine Green Fluorescence Imaging for Colorectal Surgery: A Health Technology Assessment》。</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-8fc25ce2b75f8aff1edca1ab559f8e00-chunk-000</data>
